OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey is
OL,7,Fgiving a speech at his party's autumn
OL,8,Fconference in Brighton - watch live
OL,9,Fabove
OL,11,FThe Lib Dem leader starts by warning
OL,12,Fsome want to "tear our country apart"
OL,13,Fas he refers to anti-migrant protests
OL,14,Fin Dover and Portsmouth
OL,16,FDavey speaks about the "existential
OL,17,Fthreat" of AI and how it cannot be left
OL,18,Fin the "hands of a few"
OL,20,FHe talks about the need for "community
OL,21,Fpolitics" and showing people that
OL,22,F"democracy works for them"
